{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "23b4e6bb5b198b76f0eb7d5cc082597c344f6bd0b58fb92da5de856cf916ad37", "ja": "そうだ！　先にメール送っておこうっと。\n『次のお休み、海に行かない？』……送信っと♪", "zh": "对了！先发封邮件吧。\n“下次休假，要不要去海边？”……发送♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6f81320981aba7c9b05ab7de12b28a308bba2adb8c0b61ca3e40855ee05a5468", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\nなんだか楽しそうですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n感觉你很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "a3f81f1b88f3c02c9d16e0e84e2c83f0203679f3c62703a3b53bfa0b411a122a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\n今、お姉ちゃんを海に誘ったところなんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n我刚刚正在邀请姐姐去海边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "eae65d154a7837f9ec222d9e3c44feb697d9be587621f1da0acf9fab64feef5f", "ja": "忙しそうだし、無理かもしれないんですけど……\nでも忙しいからこそ、気分転換が必要かなって。", "zh": "看起来她很忙，可能没办法答应吧……\n不过正因为忙，我才觉得她或许更需要换换心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "535a6b1fef026593906ee5e026017adc14785c80a66bba41c11340bc48931613", "ja": "そうですね、気分転換は大事だと思います。\n青羽さんはお姉さん思いですね！", "zh": "是啊，我也觉得换换心情很重要。青羽小姐真是个为姐姐着想的人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "2381771c3a55604375b62273f49870608c06485fa914152d20631ec38a06a93b", "ja": "そ、そんなことありません。私が行きたいだけで……\nああっ！　忘れてました！", "zh": "没、没有那回事。只是我自己想去而已……\n啊！我忘了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "46210168624864f15c3bab3969294220127e33999b7b736ca29c11d2b58b2b10", "ja": "さっき、社長さんからお電話があったんです。\n{$P$}さんにお話があるみたいで。", "zh": "刚才，社长打电话过来了。\n好像有事要和{$P$}先生谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "20e8b10bf4b9fef281c61d43142b7c45bf82ea4c8902272bfc642d76eaf1fdf1", "ja": "わかりました。\nさっそく、事務所に行ってきます！", "zh": "明白了。\n我马上去事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "e745a55e2b5ad72ace80241405826106cca14dcd84576c0ec2afbfcd6902f719", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃ～い♪\nお姉ちゃんとお出かけ、楽しみだなぁ。", "zh": "好——路上小心哦♪\n能和姐姐一起出门，好期待呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "dc0667e167f3ce47343e4888de0096ba99a2a9297f3f13b6d50b5ff603092f10", "ja": "お疲れ様です！", "zh": "工作辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "eb97b7f47d967debde7e308c3d264b76318770f0e053462a36cb2fbc9e104cb3", "ja": "お疲れ様です。社長、\n{$P$}さんがいらっしゃいましたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，社长。\n{$P$}先生来了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "e0cc9218abdd0c10411299f243e45326d45f278a22422a7b8519251ed1bc4749", "ja": "よくきたね、君！\nいや～、年々夏の日差しが強くなって困るねぇ。", "zh": "你来啦！\n哎呀～，一届比一届夏天的日头毒，真是让人受不了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "43e6a41c0909c40f5c4c5e27eb2220818c5f8bf6cb3fe5b751edc989bab8ea52", "ja": "社長！　……あれ、もしかして日焼けですか？　\nなんだか黒さが増したような……。", "zh": "社长！……咦，您该不会是晒黑了吧？感觉黑了不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "b2b4aecfdf527d90de524216a3b0c04979bc6da360f5a431c21bcea3ee036585", "ja": "はっはっは！　ますます、ダンディになっただろう？", "zh": "哈哈哈！我是不是变得越来越有男子气概了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "381f0e7836c69111f983db4bce13e00b584c88467e7481de0b2ae1812eeef2e2", "ja": "とはいえ、次からは日焼け止めを持っていくとしよう。\nさっきから音無君に、何度も言われてしまってね。", "zh": "话虽如此，下次还是带上防晒霜吧。\n刚才音无君一直反复提醒我来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "dbf8989b8d181c0b6f90cce6cf599cffe6a01a30c7e0db67cf53e1060437b14a", "ja": "そうですよ、社長。日焼けは健康的に見えますけど、\n乙女には悩みの種なんです。私も夏はお肌が……。", "zh": "是啊，社长。晒黑看起来很健康，\n可对女孩子来说却是烦恼的根源。我一到夏天皮肤就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "df9f41b45bfa772fc6a853dba4c8b2528f492cea550be6c824d1ea22016cc829", "ja": "気をつけます……。\nそれで社長、お話があると聞きましたが？", "zh": "我会注意的……\n对了，社长，听说您有事要和我说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "7eef6e49151b98ccfd3eb950412b03f5c57e406e538b2c50c7a6d0dc2e0fe88a", "ja": "うむ！　『ミリオンシアターシーズン』プロジェクト、\nダイヤチームの南エリアツアーなんだが……。", "zh": "嗯！这是《百万剧场季》项目的钻石队南部地区巡演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "e6c07b9501a3fa8ee72d78f02526cd2cfdbe5cbc39302b4980bceda5b19cbf1d", "ja": "さっき、新しい曲が届いてね！\nまずは聞いてくれたまえ。", "zh": "刚才，新歌送到了哦！还请先听听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d0c5de77f2783689fac950a7eba288e10caef71f12649a66dd589e33dc5ff3e3", "ja": "夏らしく、明るい曲ですね！\n歌詞は……えっ？　テーマは、失恋ですか？", "zh": "很有夏天的气息，曲调也很明快呢！\n歌词则是……咦？主题是失恋吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "eb4d0dbb82b122cd5f05e915bf34fc9efe69291d5bdb21eacd97e9491e14ad6e", "ja": "意外ですよね？\n私も、ちょっとビックリしちゃいました。", "zh": "很意外吧？\n我也有点吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "38bc370b83add1fc7667998929d2a6ad350bd785f091464057a4541294162f5e", "ja": "でも、悔しさをバネに頑張る女の子って、\n素敵だと思うんです。私も昔は……。", "zh": "不过，我觉得把不甘化作动力、努力奋斗的女孩子，很棒呢。我以前也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "70c488600803705d8d9e7e0b5436ab2ac766c93a03367175f26a5cfe86be3f10", "ja": "う、うむ。音無君の恋バナはまた今度にして……。\nこの曲のお披露目を、ツアー公演で行いたいと思う！", "zh": "唔、唔姆。音无小姐的恋爱故事还是留到下次吧……\n我想在巡演演出中，正式公布这首歌曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "cd8e2b87890a6f2fb2c4b96b833ac49322eb05989ce787f339f119a1bcf0c8f5", "ja": "南エリアツアーの他の公演同様、詳細は君に任せよう。\nよろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "和南部区域巡演的其他公演一样，具体安排就交给你了。\n拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e15cdb1656298cb66ad0cb3ead54b0ddda86569f9d6b4bb83dc3e1e6f31c3d8f", "ja": "わかりました！　この曲のお披露目に\n相応しいメンバーを考えてみたいと思います。", "zh": "明白了！我会去考虑适合这首歌\n首次亮相的合适人选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "91e1b68c14510979edd04705eeee7ecc3586cb363e2f3e1f32d1a7bfcc2af748", "ja": "南エリアのツアー、見どころがいっぱいですね。\n私も、とっても楽しみです♪", "zh": "南部地区的巡演看点十足呢。\n我也非常期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "016bf99236c668b4a58c91129182311a1224945fe06d894414cd47146e5a28f1", "ja": "（失恋をバネにして、元気を届ける。それに相応しい\nメンバー……うん。今回も、暑い公演になりそうだ！）", "zh": "（把失恋化作动力，传递活力。与此相称的成员……嗯，这次也会是场火热的公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
